# Logs
**/logs
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*
**/lerna-debug.log*

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-ssr
**/*.local

# dependencies
**/.pnp
**/.pnp.*
**/.yarn/*
!**/.yarn/patches
!**/.yarn/plugins
!**/.yarn/releases
!**/.yarn/versions

# Editor directories and files
**/.vscode/*
!**/.vscode/extensions.json
**/.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/*.suo
**/*.ntvs*
**/*.njsproj
**/*.sln
**/*.sw?

# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
